{"id":"marsch","lemma":"Marsch","pos":"noun","rank":3159,"glosses":["march"],"ipa":"/maʁʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b1/De-Marsch.ogg/De-Marsch.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Marsches","plural":"Märsche"},"examples":[{"text":"Er war erschöpft von seinem langen Marsch.","en":"He was tired from his long walk.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"exhausted"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"to reach, to grab"},null]},{"text":"Ein Marsch von wenigen Minuten brachte mich zum Strand.","en":"A few minutes' walk brought me to the shore.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"little, few","l":"wenig"},{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"},{"g":"brought"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"beach"}]},{"text":"Das Blasorchester spielte drei Märsche.","en":"The brass band played three marches.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},null]}]}